  "description": "Everything a Capsule game's logic is written against: the simulation seam and its fixed step, input as named actions, render intent, tile grids, collision shapes and queries, and the world of scenes, entities, components and the camera, together with the scene document format and its loader. Substrate-free throughout, so game logic cannot reach a graphics device and a scene is assertable headlessly.",
